#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:-1
msgid ""
"To fund Read the Docs, we built an ad platform that doesn't track users and "
"respects their privacy."
msgstr "为 Read the Docs 提供资金支持时，我们打造了一个不追踪用户、尊重其隐私的广告平台。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:2
msgid "EthicalAds"
msgstr "EthicalAds"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:8
msgid ""
"Read the Docs is a large, free web service. There is one proven business "
"model to support this kind of site: **Advertising**. We are building the "
"advertising model we want to exist, and we're calling it **EthicalAds**."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 是一项大型免费 Web 服务。支撑这类站点有一项经过验证的商业模式：**广告** "
"。我们正在构建我们希望存在的广告模式，并称之为 **EthicalAds** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:13
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**EthicalAds respect users while providing value to advertisers.** We don't "
"track you, sell your data, or anything else. We simply show ads to users, "
"based on the content of the pages you look at. We also give 10% of our ad "
"space to :ref:`community projects <advertising/ethical-advertising:Community"
" Ads>`, as our way of saying thanks to the open source community."
msgstr ""
"**EthicalAds 在为广告主提供价值的同时尊重用户。** "
"我们不追踪你、不出售你的数据，也不做其他类似的事。我们只是根据你浏览页面的内容向用户展示广告。我们还将 10% 的广告位留给 :ref:`社区项目 "
"<advertising/ethical-advertising:Community Ads>` ，以此向开源社区致谢。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:19
msgid ""
"We talk a bit below about :ref:`our worldview on advertising <advertising"
"/ethical-advertising:Our Worldview>`, if you want to know more."
msgstr ""
"下文我们会聊聊 :ref:`我们关于广告的世界观 <advertising/ethical-advertising:Our Worldview>` "
"，若你想了解更多可继续阅读。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:22
msgid "Are you a marketer?"
msgstr "你是营销人员吗？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:24
msgid ""
"We built a `whole business <https://www.ethicalads.io/?ref=rtd-docs>`_ "
"around privacy-focused advertising. If you're trying to reach developers, we"
" have a network of hand-approved sites (including Read the Docs) where your "
"ads are shown."
msgstr ""
"我们围绕注重隐私的广告打造了 `一整套业务 <https://www.ethicalads.io/?ref=rtd-docs>`_ "
"。若你想触达开发者，我们拥有一个经人工审核的站点网络（包含 Read the Docs），你的广告会在这些站点展示。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:31
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "反馈"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:33
msgid ""
"We're a community, and we value your feedback. If you ever want to reach out"
" about this effort, feel free to `shoot us an email "
"<mailto:rev@readthedocs.org>`_."
msgstr "我们是一个社区，重视你的反馈。若你想就此项工作联系我们，欢迎 `给我们发邮件 <mailto:rev@readthedocs.org>`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:38
msgid ""
"You can :ref:`opt out <advertising/ethical-advertising:Opting out>` of "
"having paid ads on your projects, or seeing paid ads if you want. You will "
"still see :ref:`community ads <advertising/ethical-advertising:Community "
"Ads>`, which we run at no cost that promote community projects."
msgstr ""
"你可以 :ref:`选择退出 <advertising/ethical-advertising:Opting out>` "
"在你的项目上投放付费广告，或选择不看付费广告。你仍会看到 :ref:`社区广告 <advertising/ethical-"
"advertising:Community Ads>` ，我们零成本投放它们以推广社区项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:44
msgid "Our worldview"
msgstr "我们的世界观"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:46
msgid "We're building the advertising model we want to exist:"
msgstr "我们正在构建我们希望存在的广告模式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:48
msgid "We don't track you"
msgstr "我们不追踪你"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:49
msgid "We don't sell your data"
msgstr "我们不出售你的数据"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:50
msgid "We host everything ourselves, no third-party scripts or images"
msgstr "所有内容都由我们自行托管，不使用第三方脚本或图片"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:52
msgid ""
"**We're doing newspaper advertising, on the internet.** For a hundred years,"
" newspapers put an ad on the page, some folks would see it, and advertisers "
"would pay for this. This is our model."
msgstr "**我们就是互联网上的报纸广告。** 长期以来，报纸把广告放在版面上，有些人看到它，广告主为此付费。我们的模式正是如此。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:60
msgid ""
"So much ad tech has been built to track users. Following them across the "
"web, from site to site, showing the same ads and gathering data about them. "
"Then retailers sell your purchase data to try and attribute sales to "
"advertising. Now there is an industry in doing `fake ad clicks`_ and other "
"scams, which leads the ad industry to track you even more intrusively to "
"know more about you. The current advertising industry is in a vicious "
"downward spiral."
msgstr ""
"大量广告技术被开发出来用于追踪用户——跨网站跟随你，从一个站点到另一个站点，展示相同广告并收集你的数据。随后零售商出售你的购买数据，试图把销售归因于广告。如今甚至出现了专门制造"
" `fake ad clicks`_ 等骗局的行业，迫使广告行业更加侵入性地追踪你以获取更多信息。当前广告行业正处于恶性循环的下行螺旋中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:69
msgid ""
"As developers, we understand the `massive downsides`_ of the current "
"advertising industry. This includes malware, slow site performance, and huge"
" databases of your personal data being sold to the highest bidder."
msgstr ""
"作为开发者，我们理解当前广告行业的 `massive downsides`_ "
"，包括恶意软件、缓慢的站点性能，以及你的个人数据被整合成庞大数据库后出售给出价最高者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:75
msgid ""
"The trend in advertising is to have larger and larger ads. They should run "
"before your content, they should take over the page, the bigger, weirder, or"
" flashier the better."
msgstr "广告的趋势是越来越大。它们应该在你内容之前运行，应该占据整个页面，越大、越怪异、越炫目越好。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:84
msgid "We opt out"
msgstr "我们选择退出"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:86
msgid "We don't store personal information about you."
msgstr "我们不存储你的个人信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:87
msgid "We only keep track of views and clicks."
msgstr "我们只记录展示和点击。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:88
msgid "We don't build a profile of your personality to sell ads against."
msgstr "我们不会构建你个人特征的画像来定向投放广告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:89
msgid ""
"We only show high quality ads from companies that are of interest to "
"developers."
msgstr "我们只展示来自开发者关注公司的优质广告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:91
msgid ""
"We are running a single, small, unobtrusive ad on documentation pages. The "
"products should be interesting to you. The ads won't flash or move."
msgstr "我们在文档页面上只投放一个小型、不打扰的广告。产品应该对你有兴趣。广告不会闪烁或移动。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:97
msgid "We run the ads we want to have on our site, in a way that makes us feel good."
msgstr "我们以让自己感到舒服的方式，投放我们希望在自己站点上出现的广告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:101
msgid "Additional details"
msgstr "更多细节"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:103
msgid ""
"We have additional documentation on the :doc:`technical details of our "
"advertising <advertising-details>` including our Do Not Track policy and our"
" use of analytics."
msgstr ""
"我们另有文档说明 :doc:`广告的技术细节 <advertising-details>` ，包括我们的 Do Not Track "
"政策以及分析数据的使用方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:106
msgid "We have an `advertising FAQ`_ written for advertisers."
msgstr "我们为广告主编写了 `advertising FAQ`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:107
msgid ""
"We have gone into more detail about our views in our `blog post "
"<https://blog.readthedocs.com/ads-on-read-the-docs/>`_ about this topic."
msgstr ""
"我们在关于此主题的 `博客文章 <https://blog.readthedocs.com/ads-on-read-the-docs/>`_ "
"中更详细地阐述了我们的观点。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:109
msgid ""
"Eric Holscher, one of our co-founders `talks a bit more "
"<https://www.ericholscher.com/blog/2016/aug/31/funding-oss-marketing-"
"money/>`_ about funding open source this way on his blog."
msgstr ""
"我们的联合创始人之一 Eric Holscher 在他的博客上 `进一步讨论了 "
"<https://www.ericholscher.com/blog/2016/aug/31/funding-oss-marketing-"
"money/>`_ 以这种方式资助开源。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:112
msgid ""
"After proving our ad model as a way to fund open source and building our ad "
"serving infrastructure, we launched the `EthicalAds network "
"<https://www.ethicalads.io?ref=rtd-docs>`_ to help other projects be "
"sustainable."
msgstr ""
"在证明我们的广告模式可以作为资助开源的方式、并建成广告投放基础设施后，我们推出了 `EthicalAds 网络 "
"<https://www.ethicalads.io?ref=rtd-docs>`_ ，帮助其他项目实现可持续发展。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:119
msgid "Join us"
msgstr "加入我们"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:121
msgid ""
"We're building the advertising model we want to exist. We hope that others "
"will join us in this mission:"
msgstr "我们正在构建我们希望存在的广告模式，希望有更多人加入这项使命："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:124
msgid ""
"**If you're a developer**, `talk to your marketing folks "
"<https://www.ericholscher.com/blog/2016/aug/31/funding-oss-marketing-"
"money/>`_ about using advertising that respects your privacy."
msgstr ""
"**如果你是开发者** ，`与你的营销同事聊聊 <https://www.ericholscher.com/blog/2016/aug/31"
"/funding-oss-marketing-money/>`_ 使用尊重隐私的广告方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:126
msgid ""
"**If you're a marketer**, vote with your dollars and support us in building "
"the ad model we want to exist. `Get more information "
"<https://www.ethicalads.io/advertisers/?ref=rtd-docs>`_ on what we offer."
msgstr ""
"**如果你是营销人员** ，用你的预算投票支持我们构建希望存在的广告模式。`了解更多信息 "
"<https://www.ethicalads.io/advertisers/?ref=rtd-docs>`_ 了解我们提供什么。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:132
msgid "Community Ads"
msgstr "社区广告"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:134
msgid ""
"There are a large number of projects, conferences, and initiatives that we "
"care about in the software and open source ecosystems. A large number of "
"them operate like we did in the past, with almost no income. Our Community "
"Ads program will highlight some of these projects."
msgstr "在软件和开源生态中，有大量我们关注的项目、会议和倡议。其中许多像我们过去那样运营，几乎没有收入。我们的社区广告计划将重点推介其中一些项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:139
msgid "There are a few qualifications for our Community Ads program:"
msgstr "我们的社区广告计划有若干资格要求："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:141
msgid ""
"Your organization and the linked site should not be trying to entice "
"visitors to buy a product or service. We make an exception for conferences "
"around open source projects if they are run not for profit and soliciting "
"donations for open source projects."
msgstr "你的组织和关联站点不应以诱导访客购买产品或服务为目的。若围绕开源项目的会议以非营利方式举办并为开源项目募款，我们对此作例外处理。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:145
msgid "A software project should have an `OSI approved license`_."
msgstr "软件项目应采用 `OSI approved license`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:146
msgid ""
"We will not run a community ad for an organization tied to one of our paid "
"advertisers."
msgstr "我们不会为与我们的付费广告主存在关联的组织投放社区广告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:149
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We'll show 10% of our ad inventory each month to support initiatives that we"
" care about. Please `complete an application`_ to be considered for our "
"Community Ads program."
msgstr "我们每月会拿出 10% 的广告库存支持我们关注的各类倡议。请 `complete an application`_ 以参与我们的社区广告计划。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:157
msgid "Opting out"
msgstr "选择退出"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:159
msgid "We have added multiple ways to opt out of the advertising on Read the Docs."
msgstr "我们提供了多种方式让你退出 Read the Docs 上的广告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:161
msgid ""
"`Gold members <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/gold/>`_ may remove "
"advertising from their projects for all visitors."
msgstr "`Gold 成员 <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/gold/>`_ 可以为所有访客移除其项目上的广告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:164
msgid "You can opt out of seeing paid advertisements on documentation pages:"
msgstr "你可以选择不在文档页面上看到付费广告："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:166
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`<Username dropdown> --> Settings --> Advertising`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`<Username dropdown> --> Settings --> Advertising` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:167
msgid "Uncheck :guilabel:`See paid advertising`."
msgstr "取消勾选 :guilabel:`See paid advertising` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:168
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Update advertisement preference`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Update advertisement preference` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:170
msgid ""
"You will still see :ref:`community ads <advertising/ethical-"
"advertising:Community Ads>` for open source projects and conferences."
msgstr "你仍会看到面向开源项目和会议的 :ref:`社区广告 <advertising/ethical-advertising:Community Ads>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:173
msgid ""
"Project owners can also opt out of paid advertisements for their projects. "
"You can change these options:"
msgstr "项目所有者也可为其项目退出付费广告。你可以更改这些选项："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:176
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Advertising`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Advertising` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:177
msgid "Change your advertising settings."
msgstr "更改你的广告设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:178
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Update advertising preference`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Update advertising preference` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:180
msgid ""
"If you are part of a company that uses Read the Docs to host documentation "
"for a commercial product, we offer :doc:`Read the Docs Business "
"</commercial/index>` that offers a completely ad-free experience, additional"
" build resources, and other great features like CDN support and private "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"如果你所在公司使用 Read the Docs 托管商业产品的文档，我们提供 :doc:`Read the Docs Business "
"</commercial/index>` ，它提供完全无广告的体验、额外构建资源，以及 CDN 支持和私有文档等优秀功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ethical-advertising.rst:184
msgid ""
"If you would like to completely remove advertising from your open source "
"project, but our commercial plans don't seem like the right fit, please `get"
" in touch`_ to discuss alternatives to advertising."
msgstr "若你想从开源项目中彻底移除广告，但我们的商业套餐似乎不合适，请 `get in touch`_ 讨论广告之外的替代方案。"

